---
import Container from './Container.astro';
---

<div class="relative" id="home">
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 grid grid-cols-2 -space-x-52 opacity-40 dark:opacity-20">
    <!-- <div class="blur-[106px] h-56 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-primary dark:from-blue-700"></div>
        <div class="blur-[106px] h-32 bg-gradient-to-b from-primary to-primary dark:to-indigo-600"></div> -->
  </div>
  <Container>
    <div class="relative pt-36 ml-auto">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center mx-auto text-center">
        <h1
          class="text-white text-balance dark:text-white font-medium text-4xl md:text-5xl xl:text-6xl flex items-center"
        >
          <span>UCL Qiskit Fall Fest </span><span
            class="text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-qff-purple to-qff-pink bg-clip-text">&nbsp;2025</span
          >
        </h1>
        <img
          src="/QFF2025Logo.svg"
          alt="Event Logo"
          class="h-[4em] md:h-[5em] xl:h-[6em] ml-4"
          style="object-fit: contain;"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- Announcement Box -->
      <div class="mt-6 flex justify-center">
        <div class="group relative w-full max-w-4xl">
          <div
            class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-qff-pink to-qff-purple rounded-2xl blur opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-75 transition duration-300"
          >
          </div>
          <div
            class="relative bg-black bg-opacity-90 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-qff-pink/30 hover:border-qff-purple/50 transition-all duration-300"
          >
            <h2 class="text-white md:text-xl text-center font-semibold leading-relaxed mb-4">
              We are pleased to announce the winners of the Qiskit Hackathon for the UCL Qiskit Fall Fest 2025!
            </h2>
            <p class="text-white text-center leading-relaxed mb-4">
              We were delighted by the high level of engagement and the incredible effort put into every submission. We
              thoroughly enjoyed playing your Quantum Battleships games and were particularly impressed by the
              creativity shown in your custom UIs and game boards.
            </p>
            <p class="text-white text-center leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Entries were judged on three core criteria: the use of Qiskit and quantum physics principles, gameplay
              experience, and the quality of documentation and rules.
            </p>
            <div class="text-white text-center leading-relaxed mb-4">
              <p class="font-semibold mb-2">The Winning Team: The Oracle</p>
              <p class="">Members: Yann Janssen, Qasim Bedford, Adam Tang</p>
              <p class="mt-2">
                Congratulations on delivering an exceptional Quantum Battleships project and a well-deserved win.
              </p>
            </div>
            <p class="text-white text-center leading-relaxed mb-4">
              We would also like to make honourable mentions in two specific categories:
            </p>
            <div class="text-white text-center leading-relaxed mb-4 space-y-2">
              <p><span class="font-semibold">Game UI:</span> The Silver Silver (Sumanth Janjanam, Argha Saha)</p>
              <p><span class="font-semibold">Qiskit Circuits:</span> Riccardo & Friends (Riccardo Zampieri)</p>
            </div>
            <p class="text-white text-center leading-relaxed">
              Thank you to everyone who participated. We look forward to hosting more challenges soon!
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Description Box -->
      <div class="mt-6 flex justify-center">
        <div class="group relative w-full max-w-4xl">
          <div
            class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-qff-purple to-qff-pink rounded-2xl blur opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-75 transition duration-300"
          >
          </div>
          <div
            class="relative bg-black bg-opacity-90 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-qff-purple/30 hover:border-qff-pink/50 transition-all duration-300"
          >
            <p class="text-white text-center leading-relaxed">
              In honour of the <span class="text-qff-pink">International Year of Quantum</span>, we hosted a
              <span class="text-qff-purple">PARTNER SPONSORED Qiskit Fall Fest 2025</span> event, supported by
              <span class="text-qff-pink">IBM Quantum</span>!
            </p>
            <p class="text-white text-center mt-4 leading-relaxed">
              Qiskit Fall Fest is a student-led, worldwide series of events that brings people together to explore and
              learn about quantum computing.
            </p>
            <p class="text-white text-center mt-4 font-semibold leading-relaxed">
              Thank you to everyone who attended, contributed, and helped make this event such a memorable celebration
              of innovation and curiosity!
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Organizing Team Section -->
      <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col items-center">
        <!-- Background Pattern - Extended across full page -->
        <div class="fixed inset-0 opacity-10 pointer-events-none">
          <div class="absolute top-[20%] left-[5%] w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-qff-purple animate-pulse"></div>
          <div
            class="absolute top-[35%] right-[8%] w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-qff-pink animate-pulse"
            style="animation-delay: 0.5s;"
          >
          </div>
          <div
            class="absolute top-[60%] left-[12%] w-20 h-20 rounded-full bg-qff-purple animate-pulse"
            style="animation-delay: 1s;"
          >
          </div>
          <div
            class="absolute top-[80%] right-[15%] w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-qff-pink animate-pulse"
            style="animation-delay: 1.5s;"
          >
          </div>
          <div
            class="absolute top-[45%] left-[25%] w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-qff-purple animate-pulse"
            style="animation-delay: 2s;"
          >
          </div>
          <div
            class="absolute top-[70%] right-[25%] w-18 h-18 rounded-full bg-qff-pink animate-pulse"
            style="animation-delay: 2.5s;"
          >
          </div>
          <div
            class="absolute top-[25%] left-[75%] w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-qff-pink animate-pulse"
            style="animation-delay: 3s;"
          >
          </div>
          <div
            class="absolute top-[50%] right-[70%] w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-qff-purple animate-pulse"
            style="animation-delay: 3.5s;"
          >
          </div>
          <div
            class="absolute top-[85%] left-[65%] w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-qff-pink animate-pulse"
            style="animation-delay: 4s;"
          >
          </div>
          <div
            class="absolute top-[15%] right-[45%] w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-qff-purple animate-pulse"
            style="animation-delay: 4.5s;"
          >
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center mb-8 relative z-10">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-qff-purple to-qff-pink bg-clip-text">
            ORGANISING TEAM
          </h2>
          <div class="w-24 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-qff-purple to-qff-pink mx-auto mt-2 rounded-full"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6 md:gap-8">
          <div class="group relative">
            <div
              class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-qff-purple to-qff-pink rounded-2xl blur opacity-75 group-hover:opacity-100 transition duration-300"
            >
            </div>
            <div
              class="relative bg-black bg-opacity-90 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-qff-purple/30 hover:border-qff-pink/50 transition-all duration-300 transform hover:scale-105 flex flex-col items-center w-64 text-center"
            >
              <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-qff-pink">Surabhi Luthra</h3>
              <p class="text-qff-purple/80 text-sm mt-1">Lead Organiser</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="group relative">
            <div
              class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-qff-pink to-qff-purple rounded-2xl blur opacity-75 group-hover:opacity-100 transition duration-300"
            >
            </div>
            <div
              class="relative bg-black bg-opacity-90 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-qff-pink/30 hover:border-qff-purple/50 transition-all duration-300 transform hover:scale-105 flex flex-col items-center w-64 text-center"
            >
              <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-qff-pink">Rui Rui Xie</h3>
              <p class="text-qff-purple/80 text-sm mt-1">Co-Organiser</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="group relative">
            <div
              class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-qff-purple to-qff-pink rounded-2xl blur opacity-75 group-hover:opacity-100 transition duration-300"
            >
            </div>
            <div
              class="relative bg-black bg-opacity-90 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-qff-purple/30 hover:border-qff-pink/50 transition-all duration-300 transform hover:scale-105 flex flex-col items-center w-64 text-center"
            >
              <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-qff-pink">Daniel Aliev</h3>
              <p class="text-qff-purple/80 text-sm mt-1">Co-Organiser</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</div>
